00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:08.429
&gt;&gt;&gt; We don't often equate philosophers with
bravery, but Bernard Henri levy breaks the

00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:14.059
mold. He's traveled to many of the front line
lokes we've heard about tht news. Places like

00:00:14.059 --> 00:00:20.330
