the water facilities an the hospitals. Are

00:02:07.061 --> 00:02:12.950
they losing their nerve? Are they losing their
courage?

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:20.260
&gt;&gt; I never saw that. Maybe it happens. But
I never saw that. I was in a lot of hot places

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:30.050
and what I saw is quiet bravery. Not stupid
bravery, which is a fake one, going to the

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:44.070
enemy. But the master of bravery everywhere.
Protecting the weak, putting all of the people

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:51.879
under shelter, going to fetch them under fire.
This I saw many times and this is what I report

00:02:51.879 --> 00:02:57.030
