negotiation, there will have to be in settlement.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:24.350
What do you see?
&gt;&gt; I don't believe that. Number one, if there

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:30.769
is a compromise, it would be a disaster for
all of us. When you do compromise with someone

00:03:30.769 --> 00:03:38.640
who decided that we are his enemy, and that
he declared total war against the whole civilized

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:48.561
world, it is a very bad thing. A compromise
with Putin is for all of us a bad thing, number

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:57.060
